{"seq":2,"slug":"request-merge-singleflight","title":"请求合并与单飞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/async-order-pipeline/request-merge-singleflight","wordCount":3301,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"请求合并与单飞\">请求合并与单飞</h1><p>异步下单把写路径的压力解决了，却制造了一个规模更大的读路径问题。用户提交订单后拿到一个 <code>order_id</code>，然后开始轮询「我的订单好了吗」。前端通常每 500 毫秒到 1 秒查一次，直到拿到终态。如果每秒钟有十万个用户同时在等结果，那就是每秒十万到二十万次订单状态查询——<strong>这个读压力超过了秒杀下单本身的写压力</strong>。更荒谬的是，这些查询里的绝大多数在问同一个问题：这个 <code>order_id</code> 现在是什么状态。</p>\n<p>本节讲两种把重复请求折叠掉的模式：单飞（singleflight）处理「同一时刻大量请求问同一个 key」，请求合并（batching）处理「大量请求可以攒成一次批量操作」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-读放大从哪里来\">核心概念：读放大从哪里来</h2><p>读放大的根源是<strong>轮询模型与瞬时集中</strong>的组合。</p>\n<p>用户不是均匀分布在时间轴上的——他们在秒杀开场的几秒内集中进入，然后在接下来的三十秒里集中轮询。假设有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个用户进入等待，平均每人轮询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次，那么总的读请求量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是十万量级、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是五十量级时，读请求是五百万次——而这些请求的目标只有十万个不同的 <code>order_id</code>（每用户一个）。</p>\n<p>放大倍数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N \\times k}{N} = k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 就是关键数字：<strong>每个订单被重复查询了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次</strong>。单飞的目标就是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 压到接近 1。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>poll</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = \\frac{T_{\\text{wait}}}{T_{\\text{poll}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">poll</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{wait}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户等待结果的时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>poll</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{poll}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">poll</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是轮询间隔。这个式子给出两个互相独立的杠杆：<strong>增大轮询间隔</strong>（前端退避）和<strong>在服务端消除重复查询</strong>（单飞）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"前端退避是成本最低的一步\">前端退避是成本最低的一步</h3><p>多数系统先做的是前端退避：第一次轮询 300 毫秒后，然后 500 毫秒、800 毫秒、1.3 秒……间隔指数增长直到上限。这样在用户等待的三十秒里，轮询次数从「固定间隔的 60 次」降到「约 10 次」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 直接降了六倍，而改动只有几行前端代码。</p>\n<p>但退避有两个局限。第一，它假设用户会等待——如果用户不耐烦地刷新页面，退避逻辑会被重置，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 又回去了。第二，退避只降低了平均频率，没有消除<strong>瞬时并发</strong>：退避序列的起点是统一的（都在提交后 300 毫秒查询），因此同一批次提交的用户会在时间上同步地发起查询，形成脉冲式的读峰值。这就是服务端单飞的用武之地。</p>\n<p>前端退避与服务端单飞的作用点不同，两者叠加才是完整方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>作用点</th>\n<th>降低的是什么</th>\n<th>改动成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>退避轮询</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n<td>平均轮询次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数行前端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端单飞</td>\n<td>服务端读路径</td>\n<td>同 key 的并发真实查询数</td>\n<td>一个中间件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果短 TTL</td>\n<td>服务端读路径</td>\n<td>毫秒级跟随请求</td>\n<td>一个本地缓存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"单飞-把并发的相同查询合并成一次\">单飞：把并发的相同查询合并成一次</h2><h3 id=\"工作机制\">工作机制</h3><p>单飞的语义很简单：<strong>当多个并发请求需要同一个 key 的值时，只执行一次真实查询，把所有等待者绑定到这一次查询的结果上</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant C1 as 客户端 A&#10;  participant C2 as 客户端 B&#10;  participant C3 as 客户端 C&#10;  participant S as 单飞协调器&#10;  participant D as 数据源(DB/Redis)&#10;  C1-&gt;&gt;S: 查 order_888&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;D: 发起查询 (第一个)&#10;  C2-&gt;&gt;S: 查 order_888&#10;  Note over S: 发现已有在途查询,&lt;br/&gt;挂起等待&#10;  C3-&gt;&gt;S: 查 order_888&#10;  Note over S: 同上, 挂起等待&#10;  D--&gt;&gt;S: 返回结果&#10;  S--&gt;&gt;C1: 结果&#10;  S--&gt;&gt;C2: 结果 (同一份)&#10;  S--&gt;&gt;C3: 结果 (同一份)\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant C1 as 客户端 A\n  participant C2 as 客户端 B\n  participant C3 as 客户端 C\n  participant S as 单飞协调器\n  participant D as 数据源(DB/Redis)\n  C1-&gt;&gt;S: 查 order_888\n  S-&gt;&gt;D: 发起查询 (第一个)\n  C2-&gt;&gt;S: 查 order_888\n  Note over S: 发现已有在途查询,&lt;br/&gt;挂起等待\n  C3-&gt;&gt;S: 查 order_888\n  Note over S: 同上, 挂起等待\n  D--&gt;&gt;S: 返回结果\n  S--&gt;&gt;C1: 结果\n  S--&gt;&gt;C2: 结果 (同一份)\n  S--&gt;&gt;C3: 结果 (同一份)</pre><p>三个请求，一次真实查询。如果这三个请求原本各查一次数据库，现在的查询量降到三分之一——而这三个人在同一毫秒查询同一个订单的概率在秒杀场景下非常高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单飞的关键约束\">单飞的关键约束</h3><p><strong>共享的必须是一个不可变的结果，或者一个在广播后不再被修改的值</strong>。如果查询返回的是一个可变对象，广播给多个调用者后其中一个修改了它，其他人会看到被污染的副本——这类 bug 极难排查，因为它只在并发路径上出现。实现时要么返回深拷贝，要么返回不可变视图。</p>\n<p><strong>必须有等待超时</strong>。如果第一个查询因为数据库慢而卡住，所有等待者都会一起卡住。等待者应该有一个独立的超时（通常比数据源自己的超时略长），超时后返回一个「请稍后重试」而不是无限等待。</p>\n<p><strong>错误也需要被广播</strong>。如果第一个查询失败，等待者应该收到同样的错误，而不是各自重试（那会造成重试风暴）。这一点与「失败快速」的取向一致：一次失败、一次传播、客户端统一退避。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;singleflight&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;key_prefix&quot;: &quot;order_status:&quot;,&#10;    &quot;wait_timeout_ms&quot;: 800,&#10;    &quot;on_wait_timeout&quot;: &quot;return_retry_later&quot;,&#10;    &quot;share_errors&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;result_ttl_ms&quot;: 200,&#10;    &quot;max_waiters_per_key&quot;: 5000&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"singleflight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"key_prefix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_status:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"wait_timeout_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_wait_timeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"return_retry_later\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"share_errors\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"result_ttl_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_waiters_per_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>result_ttl_ms</code> 是单飞之外的一个小优化：查询完成后，把结果在本地保留极短的时间，让紧随其后（但不是严格并发）的请求也能命中，而不必再发起一次查询。这个 TTL 必须极短——它是为了吸收「几毫秒内的重复」，而不是提供真正的缓存。<code>max_waiters_per_key</code> 限制了单个 key 能挂起多少等待者。这是一个保护：如果一个被大量用户查询的 key（比如某个所有人都关心的爆款订单）出现异常，挂起的连接数需要有上限，否则会耗尽连接池。超过上限的请求直接返回「稍后重试」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单飞的并发控制实现\">单飞的并发控制实现</h3><p>单飞的核心是一张「在途查询」表：第一个到达者成为 leader 发起真实查询，后来的请求挂到同一个条目上等待结果广播。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"inflight = {}                        # key -&gt; { done, result, err, waiters }&#10;lock     = Mutex()                   # 保护 inflight 这张表本身&#10;&#10;function get(key, query_fn, deadline):&#10;  lock.acquire()&#10;  entry = inflight.get(key)&#10;  if entry is null:                                  # 我是 leader&#10;    entry = { done: false, result: null, err: null, waiters: [] }&#10;    inflight.set(key, entry)&#10;    lock.release()&#10;    try:   entry.result = query_fn(); entry.err = null&#10;    except e: entry.err = e                          # 错误也要广播，避免重试风暴&#10;    lock.acquire(); inflight.delete(key); lock.release()&#10;    entry.done = true; broadcast(entry)              # 先删表再唤醒，见下&#10;    return unwrap(entry)&#10;  if entry.waiters.length &gt;= MAX_WAITERS_PER_KEY:    # 保护连接池&#10;    lock.release(); return RETRY_LATER&#10;  lock.release()&#10;  if not entry.wait_for(deadline):                   # 等待超时独立于数据源超时&#10;    return RETRY_LATER&#10;  return unwrap(entry)                               # 同一份结果，调用方不得修改\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>inflight = {}                        # key -> { done, result, err, waiters }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lock     = Mutex()                   # 保护 inflight 这张表本身</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function get(key, query_fn, deadline):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lock.acquire()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  entry = inflight.get(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if entry is null:                                  # 我是 leader</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    entry = { done: false, result: null, err: null, waiters: [] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    inflight.set(key, entry)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lock.release()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try:   entry.result = query_fn(); entry.err = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    except e: entry.err = e                          # 错误也要广播，避免重试风暴</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lock.acquire(); inflight.delete(key); lock.release()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    entry.done = true; broadcast(entry)              # 先删表再唤醒，见下</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return unwrap(entry)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if entry.waiters.length >= MAX_WAITERS_PER_KEY:    # 保护连接池</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lock.release(); return RETRY_LATER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lock.release()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if not entry.wait_for(deadline):                   # 等待超时独立于数据源超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return RETRY_LATER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return unwrap(entry)                               # 同一份结果，调用方不得修改</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>先在 <code>lock</code> 内完成「查表 / 建表 / 计数」三步，再释放锁去执行 <code>query_fn</code>：锁只保护表结构，不保护慢查询，否则单飞会把并发退化成串行</li>\n<li><code>inflight.delete(key)</code> 必须早于 <code>broadcast(entry)</code>：顺序颠倒会留下一小段窗口，让新请求挂到一个永远不会再被唤醒的条目上</li>\n<li>等待者超时后自行返回，但 leader 的查询继续执行——超时只影响这一个调用方，不取消共享查询</li>\n<li>返回的对象必须是不可变视图或深拷贝；<code>unwrap</code> 是唯一允许把内部结果交出去的地方</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"请求合并-把多次小操作攒成一次大操作\">请求合并：把多次小操作攒成一次大操作</h2><p>单飞解决的是<strong>读</strong>的重复。请求合并解决的是<strong>写</strong>的碎片化：大量独立的小写操作，如果可以合并成一次批量操作，就能把往返次数与数据库开销降下来。两者的适用面不同，混用会造成「合并了不该合并的东西」或「单飞了无法共享的东西」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>折叠的对象</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>不适合的场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单飞</td>\n<td>同一 key 的并发读</td>\n<td>严格并发（同毫秒）</td>\n<td>各请求 key 不同、结果不可共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求合并</td>\n<td>大量不同 key 的小读/写</td>\n<td>时间窗内到达的批量</td>\n<td>单个请求自身延迟敏感、水位线低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"订单状态批量查询\">订单状态批量查询</h3><p>最典型的场景是「我的订单列表」或者运营侧的「批量查状态」。用户提交秒杀订单后，前端可能同时需要查这个订单的状态和这个活动下所有订单的状态。如果逐个查询，N 个订单就是 N 次查询。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT order_id, state, created_at, paid_at&#10;  FROM orders&#10; WHERE order_id = ANY(:order_ids);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at, paid_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY(:order_ids);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一次 <code>ANY</code> 查询替代 N 次单条查询，网络往返从 N 降到 1。数据库侧的收益更大：单条查询每次都要解析、规划、执行，批量查询把解析与规划的成本摊销到 N 行上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合并的聚集窗口\">合并的聚集窗口</h3><p>合并需要一个「等一小会儿，看还有没有更多请求」的窗口。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;batch_reader&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;max_batch_size&quot;: 200,&#10;    &quot;max_delay_ms&quot;: 5,&#10;    &quot;flush_on_full&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;dedupe_keys&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;timeout_ms&quot;: 200&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"batch_reader\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_batch_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_delay_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"flush_on_full\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dedupe_keys\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"timeout_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_delay_ms</code> 是核心参数，它是<strong>吞吐与延迟的直接权衡</strong>：窗口越大，批得越满，吞吐越高；窗口越大，每个请求的等待也越久。秒杀订单状态查询对延迟敏感（用户在看进度），因此这个窗口通常设得很小（毫秒级）。<code>dedupe_keys</code> 是另一个重要开关：如果同一批里有两个请求查同一个 <code>order_id</code>（在单飞之后，这会发生在稍有时间差的请求上），合并时应该去重，避免数据库返回重复行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合并的失效模式\">合并的失效模式</h3><p>请求合并有三个必须处理的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>批内单点失败</strong>：一批 200 个订单里有一个查询失败（比如某个 <code>order_id</code> 格式非法），不应该让整批失败。应该把查询拆成「成功的」和「失败的」两部分，失败的按单条重试或直接返回错误，成功的照常返回。整批失败会导致一次小错误放大成 200 个用户看到错误。</p>\n<p><strong>超时与取消</strong>：如果批查询整体超时，所有等待者都要被通知。丢弃整批结果是最安全的做法——部分返回会造成「有的用户拿到结果、有的没有」的不一致体验，且难以排查。</p>\n<p><strong>合并放大延迟</strong>：合并的本质是「用延迟换吞吐」。如果系统的实际瓶颈不在数据库往返而在别处（比如网络带宽、序列化），合并带来的收益会低于它引入的延迟。因此启用前应该先确认瓶颈确实是「大量的小型数据库往返」。</p>\n<p>聚集窗口的实现要点是「谁先到就由谁触发 flush」，以及等待者与批次之间用 channel 而非共享变量传递结果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"pending = []                         # 待合并的请求&#10;timer   = null&#10;lock    = Mutex()&#10;&#10;function read(order_ids, reply_chan):&#10;  lock.acquire()&#10;  pending.append({ order_ids, reply_chan })&#10;  if pending.length &gt;= MAX_BATCH_SIZE:&#10;    flush_locked()                   # 攒满立即触发，不等窗口结束&#10;  else if timer is null:&#10;    timer = schedule_after(MAX_DELAY_MS, flush)   # 只由第一个请求起定时器&#10;  lock.release()&#10;  return reply_chan.recv(TIMEOUT_MS) # 等待者按各自的超时接收&#10;&#10;function flush():&#10;  lock.acquire(); flush_locked(); lock.release()&#10;&#10;function flush_locked():&#10;  batch = pending; pending = []; timer = null&#10;  ids   = dedupe(flatten(batch.map(b =&gt; b.order_ids)))   # 批内去重，避免重复行&#10;  try:&#10;    rows = db.query(&quot;... WHERE order_id = ANY(:ids)&quot;, ids)&#10;    index = group_by(rows, r =&gt; r.order_id)&#10;    for b in batch: b.reply_chan.send(map_each(b.order_ids, index))   # 缺失的 key 各自回空&#10;  except e:&#10;    for b in batch: b.reply_chan.send_error(RETRY_LATER)  # 整批统一失败，不部分返回\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>pending = []                         # 待合并的请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>timer   = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lock    = Mutex()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function read(order_ids, reply_chan):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lock.acquire()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pending.append({ order_ids, reply_chan })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if pending.length >= MAX_BATCH_SIZE:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    flush_locked()                   # 攒满立即触发，不等窗口结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else if timer is null:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    timer = schedule_after(MAX_DELAY_MS, flush)   # 只由第一个请求起定时器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lock.release()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return reply_chan.recv(TIMEOUT_MS) # 等待者按各自的超时接收</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function flush():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lock.acquire(); flush_locked(); lock.release()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function flush_locked():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  batch = pending; pending = []; timer = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ids   = dedupe(flatten(batch.map(b => b.order_ids)))   # 批内去重，避免重复行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rows = db.query(\"... WHERE order_id = ANY(:ids)\", ids)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    index = group_by(rows, r => r.order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for b in batch: b.reply_chan.send(map_each(b.order_ids, index))   # 缺失的 key 各自回空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  except e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for b in batch: b.reply_chan.send_error(RETRY_LATER)  # 整批统一失败，不部分返回</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><code>pending</code> 的所有读写都在 <code>lock</code> 内完成，<code>flush_locked</code> 的命名就是在强调这个前提：数据库调用虽在锁内，但它不依赖等待者继续入队，因此不会死锁</li>\n<li>定时器只由「队首请求」创建，并随 flush 一起清空；若每个请求都建定时器，窗口会被不断重置，批次永远攒不满也永远不 flush</li>\n<li>整批失败时统一回错误而不做部分返回；批内确实存在的坏 key 在 <code>flush_locked</code> 之后按单条重试，二者是不同的失败层</li>\n<li><code>dedupe</code> 与「缺失 key 回空」是配套的：去重后返回行数少于请求 key 数是正常的，不能当成错误</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"轮询之外-长连接与推送\">轮询之外：长连接与推送</h2><p>轮询模型的一个根本问题是：<strong>它总是查得比需要更频繁</strong>。用户不需要每 500 毫秒知道一次状态，他只需要在状态改变时知道一次。把模型从「客户端定时问」改成「服务端状态变了主动说」，读请求量会降到与状态变化次数成正比，而不是与等待时长成正比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>请求量</th>\n<th>服务端复杂度</th>\n<th>客户端复杂度</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定间隔轮询</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>小规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退避轮询</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times k/6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中小规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退避轮询 + 单飞</td>\n<td>接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>大规模（推荐）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长连接推送</td>\n<td>与状态变化次数成正比</td>\n<td>高（连接管理）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>超大规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合（推送 + 兜底轮询）</td>\n<td>略高于状态变化次数</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>超大规模</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>长连接推送的工程代价不小：需要维持大量并发长连接（一次秒杀可能同时有几十万连接），需要处理连接中断后的状态补偿，需要在网关层支持长连接协议。因此常见的渐进路线是<strong>先用退避轮询 + 单飞</strong>（改动小、收益大），等到读请求量再次成为瓶颈时再引入长连接。混合模式是最终形态：以推送为主，但保留一个低频的兜底轮询，用于处理推送丢失的情况——这与<a href=\"soldout-fast-fail-degrade\">售罄快速失败与降级</a>里「任何通道都可能失败、必须有兜底」的思路一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>异步下单把写压力转成了读压力：每订单被轮询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>poll</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = T_{\\text{wait}} / T_{\\text{poll}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">poll</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，读放大倍数就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>前端退避是成本最低的第一步（把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 降数倍），但它无法消除「同批次用户同步发起查询」形成的瞬时读脉冲。</li>\n<li>单飞把并发相同查询合并成一次真实查询，返回共享结果必须是不可变或深拷贝，必须有等待超时与错误广播，并限制单 key 的等待者数量。</li>\n<li>请求合并把碎片写/小查询攒成批量操作，核心参数是聚集窗口（吞吐与延迟的直接权衡）；必须处理批内单点失败与整批超时。</li>\n<li>长连接推送把模型从「定时问」改成「变化时说」，请求量与状态变化次数成正比；渐进路线是退避轮询 + 单飞 → 推送 + 兜底轮询。</li>\n<li>参考：Go 官方扩展库 <code>golang.org/x/sync/singleflight</code> 的语义说明（pkg.go.dev/golang.org/x/sync/singleflight）；PostgreSQL <code>= ANY(array)</code> 批量查询语法（postgresql.org/docs/current/functions-comparisons.html）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>用户拿到了终态：要么成功，要么失败。失败的那条路径需要被处理得干净利落——尤其是「售罄」，见<a href=\"soldout-fast-fail-degrade\">售罄快速失败与降级</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"请求合并与单飞","id":"请求合并与单飞"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：读放大从哪里来","id":"核心概念-读放大从哪里来"},{"level":3,"text":"前端退避是成本最低的一步","id":"前端退避是成本最低的一步"},{"level":2,"text":"单飞：把并发的相同查询合并成一次","id":"单飞-把并发的相同查询合并成一次"},{"level":3,"text":"工作机制","id":"工作机制"},{"level":3,"text":"单飞的关键约束","id":"单飞的关键约束"},{"level":3,"text":"单飞的并发控制实现","id":"单飞的并发控制实现"},{"level":2,"text":"请求合并：把多次小操作攒成一次大操作","id":"请求合并-把多次小操作攒成一次大操作"},{"level":3,"text":"订单状态批量查询","id":"订单状态批量查询"},{"level":3,"text":"合并的聚集窗口","id":"合并的聚集窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"合并的失效模式","id":"合并的失效模式"},{"level":2,"text":"轮询之外：长连接与推送","id":"轮询之外-长连接与推送"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MQ 异步下单削峰填谷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/async-order-pipeline/mq-async-order-peakshed"},"next":{"title":"售罄快速失败与降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/async-order-pipeline/soldout-fast-fail-degrade"}}